<Site title="Privacy Notice | Lifeline Development Trust" description="How contact, volunteer and donation enquiries submitted through the Lifeline Development Trust website are handled and used to respond to visitors."><main class="wrap section prose"><p class="eyebrow">YOUR INFORMATION</p><h1>Privacy notice</h1><p>This notice covers enquiries made through the Lifeline Development Trust website.</p><h2>Information you choose to share</h2><p>Forms request your name, email, and enquiry details. A telephone number is optional. Volunteer enquiries also request your interests, availability and relevant skills.</p><h2>Why information is collected</h2><p>The Trust uses submitted details to respond to messages, discuss volunteer opportunities and handle donation enquiries. A form submission does not make a donation or confirm a placement.</p><h2>Form processing</h2><p>Enquiries are processed through Kleap’s form service, stored in the organization’s project dashboard and sent as notifications to the account owner. Please do not submit identity documents, financial credentials, medical records or other sensitive information.</p><h2>Your requests</h2><p>To ask about access, correction or deletion of information you submitted, use the <a class="text-link" href="/contact#contact-form">contact form</a> and identify the relevant enquiry. The Trust should review and maintain this notice as its practices develop.</p><h2>External services</h2><p>Google Maps is embedded on the contact page. Loading or opening it may share connection information with Google under its own privacy terms. External photographs may be delivered from third-party image services.</p></main></Site>